<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25051" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δια-κρῐδόν</span></b> , Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακρίνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>eminently,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. εἶναι ἄριστοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					12.103
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				15.108
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.53
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἠσκημένη κόμη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Am.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>precisely,</i> of measurement, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				955
			</span></i>; <i>in detail,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.721
			</span></i>; <i>distinctly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hymn.Is.
				14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>separately,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.567
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνθα καὶ ἔνθα δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					34.349
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				2.130
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Agath.
				5.7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ δ.</span> without
				<i>distinction,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τῶν ὁσίων ἢ δικαίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					5.9
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
